[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186124660 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" "question-801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :question/id #uuid "696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :question/math-academy-id "q-52485" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=-4(x+1)(x-2)?$" :question/worked-solution "The given parabola is written in factored form,\n\n$$\ny=a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2}),\n$$\n\nwith $a=-4<0.$ \n\nBecause the leading coefficient is negative, the parabola opens downward. Consequently, there is no minimum output, and the vertex corresponds to the maximum output.\n\nThe two roots of the parabola are ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=2,$ and we can find the $x$-coordinate of the vertex by taking the average of the roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2}=\\frac{-1+2}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $x=\\frac{1}{2}$ back into the function to find the $y$-value of the vertex:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-4(x+1)(x-2) \\\\  & =-4(\\frac{1}{2}+1)(\\frac{1}{2}-2) \\\\  & =-4\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{2}) \\\\  & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the vertex is $(\\frac{1}{2},9),$ and the range of the function is $(-\\infty ,9].$\n\n![](images/b4/b45df69ab8780eabce5b57a30cf7448a011361e18e28989249e1eca439b17028.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/id #uuid "27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c1176870-903e-5a26-ab27-2b891f377850" "answer-da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109" "answer-9a4b7c93-b462-5bc0-ba7c-435803992578" "answer-7621c886-17c5-53da-ad1b-817216429049" "answer-17209926-bbeb-5eac-83bc-49f7341ac4e4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c1176870-903e-5a26-ab27-2b891f377850" :answer/id #uuid "c1176870-903e-5a26-ab27-2b891f377850" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-9]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109" :answer/id #uuid "da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,9]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9a4b7c93-b462-5bc0-ba7c-435803992578" :answer/id #uuid "9a4b7c93-b462-5bc0-ba7c-435803992578" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,\\frac{9}{2}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7621c886-17c5-53da-ad1b-817216429049" :answer/id #uuid "7621c886-17c5-53da-ad1b-817216429049" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[-9,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-17209926-bbeb-5eac-83bc-49f7341ac4e4" :answer/id #uuid "17209926-bbeb-5eac-83bc-49f7341ac4e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[9,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186124659 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :question/id #uuid "80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :question/math-academy-id "q-90973" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=4{x}^{2}-16x+8?$" :question/worked-solution "The given parabola is written in standard form,\n\n$$\ny=a{x}^{2}+bx+c,\n$$\n\nwith $a=4>0,$ $b=-16,$ and $c=8.$\n\nBecause the leading coefficient is positive, the parabola opens upward. Consequently, there is no maximum output, and the vertex corresponds to the minimum output.\n\nThe $x$-coordinate of the vertex is given by\n\n$$\nx=-\\frac{b}{2a}=-\\frac{(-16)}{2\\cdot 4}=2.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute $x=2$ back into the function to find the $y$-value of the vertex:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =4{x}^{2}-16x+8 \\\\  & =4(2)^{2}-16(2)+8 \\\\  & =16-32+8 \\\\  & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the vertex is $(2,-8),$ and the range of the function is $[-8,\\infty ).$\n\n![](images/ef/ef95a03e21bf6d12fec48da87ded1230ccb124cbed480910f883520aa30a8db7.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/id #uuid "35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f90c93d2-934f-5f68-aa64-d5d3fe538685" "answer-7a968f86-b29a-5762-b0b6-f81d4df6e3f2" "answer-0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983" "answer-d42ed3a8-6555-5128-bd9e-e862bde99af1" "answer-d9bf7f88-d2a8-5c9f-8e16-3aa1dd2c39ee"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f90c93d2-934f-5f68-aa64-d5d3fe538685" :answer/id #uuid "f90c93d2-934f-5f68-aa64-d5d3fe538685" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-8]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7a968f86-b29a-5762-b0b6-f81d4df6e3f2" :answer/id #uuid "7a968f86-b29a-5762-b0b6-f81d4df6e3f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,2]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983" :answer/id #uuid "0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[-8,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d42ed3a8-6555-5128-bd9e-e862bde99af1" :answer/id #uuid "d42ed3a8-6555-5128-bd9e-e862bde99af1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[2,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d9bf7f88-d2a8-5c9f-8e16-3aa1dd2c39ee" :answer/id #uuid "d9bf7f88-d2a8-5c9f-8e16-3aa1dd2c39ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[8,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186124584 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" "question-7388c8e3-3a7a-5622-a3d6-d20be3d1209d"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" :question/id #uuid "23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" :question/math-academy-id "q-90976" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=(x+5)^{2}+8?$" :question/worked-solution "The parabola is written in vertex form, \n\n$$\ny=a(x-h)^{2}+k,\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ is the leading coefficient and $(h,k)$ is the vertex. \n\n- Since $h=-5$ and $k=8,$ the vertex is $(-5,8).$\n\n- Since $a=1>0,$ the parabola opens upwards.\n\nBecause the parabola opens upwards, there is no maximum output, and the vertex corresponds to the minimum output.\n\nTherefore, the range is $[8,\\infty ).$\n\nThe corresponding diagram is shown below.\n\n![](images/5f/5fb1f6f735e4ed9927cad0f74f21f9f774f6326ab394bf8bd5d3c596b46fe742.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8734db0a-e538-524d-84b7-4bf0586fa05d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8734db0a-e538-524d-84b7-4bf0586fa05d" :answer-field/id #uuid "8734db0a-e538-524d-84b7-4bf0586fa05d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-28d2efb0-5aa4-56cc-b125-ed6a71dc37ed" :answer-field/choices ["answer-efe7b8ae-7d1f-5a93-9a52-c281c783aa17" "answer-66f40b1c-edeb-57d4-a9cc-d6c38bfb0538" "answer-1c6cc98c-dc36-57f1-a82b-015e9d5d6a86" "answer-de4127ca-8b56-5baa-9b1e-424572e1e04d" "answer-28d2efb0-5aa4-56cc-b125-ed6a71dc37ed"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-efe7b8ae-7d1f-5a93-9a52-c281c783aa17" :answer/id #uuid "efe7b8ae-7d1f-5a93-9a52-c281c783aa17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-8,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-66f40b1c-edeb-57d4-a9cc-