["answer-bbde4b03-de67-5f6a-afdb-74ee115318d2" "answer-29cf9f64-0fb5-5d4b-a70c-86898b7e0774" "answer-aaabc716-d6a5-5674-aeb8-7bbe10594642" "answer-58ddaf4e-2b5d-5bf2-8c0a-68bed42484f1" "answer-2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bbde4b03-de67-5f6a-afdb-74ee115318d2" :answer/id #uuid "bbde4b03-de67-5f6a-afdb-74ee115318d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-16]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-29cf9f64-0fb5-5d4b-a70c-86898b7e0774" :answer/id #uuid "29cf9f64-0fb5-5d4b-a70c-86898b7e0774" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,17]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-aaabc716-d6a5-5674-aeb8-7bbe10594642" :answer/id #uuid "aaabc716-d6a5-5674-aeb8-7bbe10594642" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[-16,17]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-58ddaf4e-2b5d-5bf2-8c0a-68bed42484f1" :answer/id #uuid "58ddaf4e-2b5d-5bf2-8c0a-68bed42484f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[-16,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686" :answer/id #uuid "2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[17,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a" :question/id #uuid "801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a" :question/math-academy-id "q-154352" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=-\\frac{1}{12}(x-5)(x+7)?$" :question/worked-solution "The given parabola is written in factored form,\n\n$$\ny=a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2}),\n$$\n\nwith $a=-\\frac{1}{12}<0.$ \n\nBecause the leading coefficient is negative, the parabola opens downward. Consequently, there is no minimum output, and the vertex corresponds to the maximum output.\n\nThe two roots of the parabola are ${x}_{1}=-7$ and ${x}_{2}=5,$ and we can find the $x$-coordinate of the vertex by taking the average of the roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2}=\\frac{-7+5}{2}=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $x=-1$ back into the function to find the $y$-value of the vertex:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-\\frac{1}{12}(x-5)(x+7) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}(-1-5)(-1+7) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}\\cdot (-6)\\cdot (6) \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the vertex is $(-1,3),$ and the range of the function is $(-\\infty ,3].$\n\n![](images/f2/f2b32570242760c89292a1c19ff005b5e750c04e9e974775d2c05d42947b95d6.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5474e0d9-24c8-5a4f-a6c8-b6fbbd843bff"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5474e0d9-24c8-5a4f-a6c8-b6fbbd843bff" :answer-field/id #uuid "5474e0d9-24c8-5a4f-a6c8-b6fbbd843bff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-23fb6b86-5b86-52d1-9e26-62444809eb6d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8273ca88-2cbd-5a62-9dab-6a1a91463ddc" "answer-54cbb41f-457f-53d4-a20e-3c5586a4e85d" "answer-23fb6b86-5b86-52d1-9e26-62444809eb6d" "answer-e767e43a-c725-573d-b554-587bbf0fd4be" "answer-26f10d21-11c0-573b-96e1-a7f9cf5d54e9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8273ca88-2cbd-5a62-9dab-6a1a91463ddc" :answer/id #uuid "8273ca88-2cbd-5a62-9dab-6a1a91463ddc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-1,3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-54cbb41f-457f-53d4-a20e-3c5586a4e85d" :answer/id #uuid "54cbb41f-457f-53d4-a20e-3c5586a4e85d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-1]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23fb6b86-5b86-52d1-9e26-62444809eb6d" :answer/id #uuid "23fb6b86-5b86-52d1-9e26-62444809eb6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,3]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e767e43a-c725-573d-b554-587bbf0fd4be" :answer/id #uuid "e767e43a-c725-573d-b554-587bbf0fd4be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-\\infty ,\\infty )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-26f10d21-11c0-573b-96e1-a7f9cf5d54e9" :answer/id #uuid "26f10d21-11c0-573b-96e1-a7f9cf5d54e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[-1,3]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-a2190f4f-dc0e-5fb3-8277-22084f85f622" :activity/id #uuid "a2190f4f-dc0e-5fb3-8277-22084f85f622" :activity/title "Domain and Range of Quadratic Functions" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049828 :activity/course 17592186046658 :activity/steps ["step-9c304918-f6c7-58ef-adff-43974148f23f" "step-193c46d8-c468-5cb7-8e84-1dde0b6a8f36" "step-e64e03b2-34e5-5ab4-9adf-8a06ede100ec" "step-36af7662-75c4-5360-acdb-0c7c68a72bd3" "step-f431416b-0393-53fb-8ede-e5b628a60934"] :activity/first-step "step-9c304918-f6c7-58ef-adff-43974148f23f" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-9c304918-f6c7-58ef-adff-43974148f23f" :step/id #uuid "9c304918-f6c7-58ef-adff-43974148f23f" :step/content "question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :step/next "step-193c46d8-c468-5cb7-8e84-1dde0b6a8f36" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-193c46d8-c468-5cb7-8e84-1dde0b6a8f36" :step/id #uuid "193c46d8-c468-5cb7-8e84-1dde0b6a8f36" :step/content "question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :step/next "step-e64e03b2-34e5-5ab4-9adf-8a06ede100ec" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-e64e03b2-34e5-5ab4-9adf-8a06ede100ec" :step/id #uuid "e64e03b2-34e5-5ab4-9adf-8a06ede100ec" :step/content "question-23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" :step/next "step-36af7662-75c4-5360-acdb-0c7c68a72bd3" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-36af7662-75c4-5360-acdb-0c7c68a72bd3" :step/id #uuid "36af7662-75c4-5360-acdb-0c7c68a72bd3" :step/content "question-7388c8e3-3a7a-5622-a3d6-d20be3d1209d" :step/next "step-f431416b-0393-53fb-8ede-e5b628a60934" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-f431416b-0393-53fb-8ede-e5b628a60934" :step/id #uuid "f431416b-0393-53fb-8ede-e5b628a60934" :step/content "question-801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a" :db/ensure [:step/validate]}] "assertions" [["question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :question/id #uuid "696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070"] ["question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :question/math-academy-id "q-52485"] ["question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=-4(x+1)(x-2)?$"] ["question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :question/worked-solution "The given parabola is written in factored form,\n\n$$\ny=a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2}),\n$$\n\nwith $a=-4<0.$ \n\nBecause the leading coefficient is negative, the parabola opens downward. Consequently, there is no minimum output, and the vertex corresponds to the maximum output.\n\nThe two roots of the parabola are ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=2,$ and we can find the $x$-coordinate of the vertex by taking the average of the roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2}=\\frac{-1+2}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $x=\\frac{1}{2}$ back into the function to find the $y$-value of the vertex:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-4(x+1)(x-2) \\\\  & =-4(\\frac{1}{2}+1)(\\frac{1}{2}-2) \\\\  & =-4\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{2}) \\\\  & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the vertex is $(\\frac{1}{2},9),$ and the range of the function is $(-\\infty ,9].$\n\n![](images/b4/b45df69ab8780eabce5b57a30cf7448a011361e18e28989249e1eca439b17028.png)"] ["question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/id #uuid "27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50"] ["answer-c1176870-903e-5a26-ab27-2b891f377850" :answer/id #uuid "c1176870-903e-5a26-ab27-2b891f377850"] ["answer-c1176870-903e-5a26-ab27-2b891f377850" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c1176870-903e-5a26-ab27-2b891f377850" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-9]"] ["answer-da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109" :answer/id #uuid "da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109"] ["answer-da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,9]"] ["answer-9a4b7c93-b462-5bc0-ba7c-435803992578" :answer/id #uuid "9a4b7c93-b462-5bc0-ba7c-435803992578"] ["answer-9a4b7c93-b462-5bc0-ba7c-435803992578" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9a4b7c93-b462-5bc0-ba7c-435803992578" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,\\frac{9}{2}]"] ["answer-7621c886-17c5-53da-ad1b-817216429049" :answer/id #uuid "7621c886-17c5-53da-ad1b-817216429049"] ["answer-7621c886-17c5-53da-ad1b-817216429049" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7621c886-17c5-53da-ad1b-817216429049" :answer/value "[-9,\\infty )"] ["answer-17209926-bbeb-5eac-83bc-49f7341ac4e4" :answer/id #uuid "17209926-bbeb-5eac-83bc-49f7341ac4e4"] ["answer-17209926-bbeb-5eac-83bc-49f7341ac4e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-17209926-bbeb-5eac-83bc-49f7341ac4e4" :answer/value "[9,\\infty )"] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/correct "answer-da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109"] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/choices "answer-c1176870-903e-5a26-ab27-2b891f377850"] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/choices "answer-da77021a-bceb-532a-a073-05a140340109"] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/choices "answer-9a4b7c93-b462-5bc0-ba7c-435803992578"] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/choices "answer-7621c886-17c5-53da-ad1b-817216429049"] ["answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50" :answer-field/choices "answer-17209926-bbeb-5eac-83bc-49f7341ac4e4"] ["question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-27f1f3fe-7cc9-517f-8e81-f601638bcf50"] [17592186124660 :knowledge-point/questions "question-696aa9f5-c58d-5b74-b314-032b710e1070"] ["question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :question/id #uuid "80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d"] ["question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :question/math-academy-id "q-90973"] ["question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=4{x}^{2}-16x+8?$"] ["question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :question/worked-solution "The given parabola is written in standard form,\n\n$$\ny=a{x}^{2}+bx+c,\n$$\n\nwith $a=4>0,$ $b=-16,$ and $c=8.$\n\nBecause the leading coefficient is positive, the parabola opens upward. Consequently, there is no maximum output, and the vertex corresponds to the minimum output.\n\nThe $x$-coordinate of the vertex is given by\n\n$$\nx=-\\frac{b}{2a}=-\\frac{(-16)}{2\\cdot 4}=2.\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute $x=2$ back into the function to find the $y$-value of the vertex:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =4{x}^{2}-16x+8 \\\\  & =4(2)^{2}-16(2)+8 \\\\  & =16-32+8 \\\\  & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the vertex is $(2,-8),$ and the range of the function is $[-8,\\infty ).$\n\n![](images/ef/ef95a03e21bf6d12fec48da87ded1230ccb124cbed480910f883520aa30a8db7.png)"] ["question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/id #uuid "35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647"] ["answer-f90c93d2-934f-5f68-aa64-d5d3fe538685" :answer/id #uuid "f90c93d2-934f-5f68-aa64-d5d3fe538685"] ["answer-f90c93d2-934f-5f68-aa64-d5d3fe538685" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f90c93d2-934f-5f68-aa64-d5d3fe538685" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-8]"] ["answer-7a968f86-b29a-5762-b0b6-f81d4df6e3f2" :answer/id #uuid "7a968f86-b29a-5762-b0b6-f81d4df6e3f2"] ["answer-7a968f86-b29a-5762-b0b6-f81d4df6e3f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7a968f86-b29a-5762-b0b6-f81d4df6e3f2" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,2]"] ["answer-0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983" :answer/id #uuid "0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983"] ["answer-0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983" :answer/value "[-8,\\infty )"] ["answer-d42ed3a8-6555-5128-bd9e-e862bde99af1" :answer/id #uuid "d42ed3a8-6555-5128-bd9e-e862bde99af1"] ["answer-d42ed3a8-6555-5128-bd9e-e862bde99af1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d42ed3a8-6555-5128-bd9e-e862bde99af1" :answer/value "[2,\\infty )"] ["answer-d9bf7f88-d2a8-5c9f-8e16-3aa1dd2c39ee" :answer/id #uuid "d9bf7f88-d2a8-5c9f-8e16-3aa1dd2c39ee"] ["answer-d9bf7f88-d2a8-5c9f-8e16-3aa1dd2c39ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d9bf7f88-d2a8-5c9f-8e16-3aa1dd2c39ee" :answer/value "[8,\\infty )"] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/correct "answer-0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983"] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/choices "answer-f90c93d2-934f-5f68-aa64-d5d3fe538685"] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/choices "answer-7a968f86-b29a-5762-b0b6-f81d4df6e3f2"] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/choices "answer-0cb036d9-e326-56a6-af20-d9122d7ee983"] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/choices "answer-d42ed3a8-6555-5128-bd9e-e862bde99af1"] ["answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647" :answer-field/choices "answer-d9bf7f88-d2a8-5c9f-8e16-3aa1dd2c39ee"] ["question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-35a9b016-1d9a-50b3-99ea-2c94ba11f647"] [17592186124659 :knowledge-point/questions "question-80c34b41-edf2-5eff-b425-6a4c1d24a96d"] ["question-23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" :question/id #uuid "23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750"] ["question-23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" :question/math-academy-id "q-90976"] ["question-23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=(x+5)^{2}+8?$"] ["question-23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" :question/worked-solution "The parabola is written in vertex form, \n\n$$\ny=a(x-h)^{2}+k,\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ is the leading coefficient and $(h,k)$ is the vertex. \n\n- Since $h=-5$ and $k=8,$ the vertex is $(-5,8).$\n\n- Since $a=1>0,$ the parabola opens upwards.\n\nBecause the parabola opens upwards, there is no maximum output, and the vertex corresponds to the minimum output.\n\nTherefore, the range is $[8,\\infty ).$\n\nThe corresponding diagram is shown below.\n\n![](images/5f/5fb1f6f735e4ed9927cad0f74f21f9f774f6326ab394bf8bd5d3c596b46fe742.png)"] ["question-23234432-459d-5fe7-bd8b-f778d4370750" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-8734db0a-e538-524d-84b7-4bf0586fa05d" :answer-field/id #uuid "8734db0a-e538-524d-84b7-4bf0586fa05d"] ["answer-efe7b8ae-7d1f-5a93-9a52-c281c783aa17" :answer/id #uuid "efe7b8ae-7d1f-5a93-9a52-c281c783aa17"] ["answer-efe7b8ae-7d1f-5a93-9a52-c281c783aa17" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-efe7b8ae-7d1f-5a93-9a52-c281c783aa17" :answer/value "(-8,\\infty )"] ["answer-66f40b1c-edeb-57d4-a9cc-d6c38bfb0538" :answer/id #uuid "66f40b1c-edeb-57d4-a9cc-d6c38bfb0538"] ["answer-66f40b1c-edeb-57d4-a9cc-d6c38bfb0538" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-66f40b1c-edeb-57d4-a9cc-d6c38bfb0538" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-5)"] ["answer-1c6cc98c-dc36-57f1-a82b-015e9d5d6a86" :answer/id #uuid "1c6cc98c-dc36-57f1-a82b-015e9d5d6a86"] ["answer-1c6cc98c-dc36-57f1-a82b-015e9d5d6a86" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1c6cc98c-dc36-57f1-a82b-015e9d5d6a86" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,8]"] ["answer-de4127ca-8b56-5baa-9b1e-424572e1e04d" :answer/id #uuid "de4127ca-8b56-5baa-9b1e-424572e1e04d"] ["answer-de4127ca-8b56-5baa-9b1e-424572e1e04d" :answer/type :answer.type/math