ex. \n\n- Since $h=16$ and $k=17,$ the vertex is $(16,17).$\n\n- Since $a=1>0,$ the parabola opens upwards.\n\nBecause the parabola opens upwards, there is no maximum output, and the vertex corresponds to the minimum output. \n\nTherefore, the range is $[17,\\infty ).$\n\nThe corresponding diagram is shown below.\n\n![](images/ef/ef4e0bbd902f2904316c5a9db094b85ec8942c045020434171b9616077e6e3a3.png)"] ["question-7388c8e3-3a7a-5622-a3d6-d20be3d1209d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/id #uuid "ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a"] ["answer-bbde4b03-de67-5f6a-afdb-74ee115318d2" :answer/id #uuid "bbde4b03-de67-5f6a-afdb-74ee115318d2"] ["answer-bbde4b03-de67-5f6a-afdb-74ee115318d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bbde4b03-de67-5f6a-afdb-74ee115318d2" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-16]"] ["answer-29cf9f64-0fb5-5d4b-a70c-86898b7e0774" :answer/id #uuid "29cf9f64-0fb5-5d4b-a70c-86898b7e0774"] ["answer-29cf9f64-0fb5-5d4b-a70c-86898b7e0774" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-29cf9f64-0fb5-5d4b-a70c-86898b7e0774" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,17]"] ["answer-aaabc716-d6a5-5674-aeb8-7bbe10594642" :answer/id #uuid "aaabc716-d6a5-5674-aeb8-7bbe10594642"] ["answer-aaabc716-d6a5-5674-aeb8-7bbe10594642" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-aaabc716-d6a5-5674-aeb8-7bbe10594642" :answer/value "[-16,17]"] ["answer-58ddaf4e-2b5d-5bf2-8c0a-68bed42484f1" :answer/id #uuid "58ddaf4e-2b5d-5bf2-8c0a-68bed42484f1"] ["answer-58ddaf4e-2b5d-5bf2-8c0a-68bed42484f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-58ddaf4e-2b5d-5bf2-8c0a-68bed42484f1" :answer/value "[-16,\\infty )"] ["answer-2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686" :answer/id #uuid "2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686"] ["answer-2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686" :answer/value "[17,\\infty )"] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/correct "answer-2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686"] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/choices "answer-bbde4b03-de67-5f6a-afdb-74ee115318d2"] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/choices "answer-29cf9f64-0fb5-5d4b-a70c-86898b7e0774"] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/choices "answer-aaabc716-d6a5-5674-aeb8-7bbe10594642"] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/choices "answer-58ddaf4e-2b5d-5bf2-8c0a-68bed42484f1"] ["answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a" :answer-field/choices "answer-2757a40b-16a0-5fd5-b8d7-20e69914a686"] ["question-7388c8e3-3a7a-5622-a3d6-d20be3d1209d" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-ad5b693d-35ff-5edb-8938-efc3a2fae88a"] [17592186124584 :knowledge-point/questions "question-7388c8e3-3a7a-5622-a3d6-d20be3d1209d"] ["question-801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a" :question/id #uuid "801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a"] ["question-801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a" :question/math-academy-id "q-154352"] ["question-801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x)=-\\frac{1}{12}(x-5)(x+7)?$"] ["question-801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a" :question/worked-solution "The given parabola is written in factored form,\n\n$$\ny=a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2}),\n$$\n\nwith $a=-\\frac{1}{12}<0.$ \n\nBecause the leading coefficient is negative, the parabola opens downward. Consequently, there is no minimum output, and the vertex corresponds to the maximum output.\n\nThe two roots of the parabola are ${x}_{1}=-7$ and ${x}_{2}=5,$ and we can find the $x$-coordinate of the vertex by taking the average of the roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2}=\\frac{-7+5}{2}=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $x=-1$ back into the function to find the $y$-value of the vertex:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-\\frac{1}{12}(x-5)(x+7) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}(-1-5)(-1+7) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}\\cdot (-6)\\cdot (6) \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the vertex is $(-1,3),$ and the range of the function is $(-\\infty ,3].$\n\n![](images/f2/f2b32570242760c89292a1c19ff005b5e750c04e9e974775d2c05d42947b95d6.png)"] ["question-801c507c-bbca-51e6-b6da-3b26d3d5946a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-5474e0d9-24c8-5a4f-a6c8-b6fbbd843bff" :answer-field/id #uuid "5474e0d9-24c8-5a4f-a6c8-b6fbbd843bff"] ["answer-8273ca88-2cbd-5a62-9dab-6a1a91463ddc" :answer/id #uuid "8273ca88-2cbd-5a62-9dab-6a1a91463ddc"] ["answer-8273ca88-2cbd-5a62-9dab-6a1a91463ddc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8273ca88-2cbd-5a62-9dab-6a1a91463ddc" :answer/value "(-1,3)"] ["answer-54cbb41f-457f-53d4-a20e-3c5586a4e85d" :answer/id #uuid "54cbb41f-457f-53d4-a20e-3c5586a4e85d"] ["answer-54cbb41f-457f-53d4-a20e-3c5586a4e85d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-54cbb41f-457f-53d4-a20e-3c5586a4e85d" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,-1]"] ["answer-23fb6b86-5b86-52d1-9e26-62444809eb6d" :answer/id #uuid "23fb6b86-5b86-52d1-9e26-62444809eb6d"] ["answer-23fb6b86-5b86-52d1-9e26-62444809eb6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-23fb6b86-5b86-52d1-9e26-62444809eb6d" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,3]"] ["answer-e767e43a-c725-573d-b554-587bbf0fd4be" :answer/id #uuid "e767e43a-c725-573d-b554-587bbf0fd4be"] ["answer-e767e43a-c725-573d-b554-587bbf0fd4be" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e767e43a-c725-573d-b554-587bbf0fd4be" :answer/value "(-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["answer-26f10d21-11c0-573b-96e1-a7f9cf5d54e9" :answer/id #uuid "26f10d21-11c0-573b-96e1-a7f9cf5d54e9"] ["answer-26f10d21-11c0-573b-96e1-a7f9cf5d54e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-26f10d21-11c0-573b-96e1-a7f9cf5d54e9" :answer/value "[-1,3]"] ["answer-field-5474e0d9-24c8-5a4f-a6c8-b6fbbd843bff" :answer-field/